BT /F1 11 Tf 50 740 Td 15 TL (STANDARD OPERATING PROCEDURE  PUMP BEARING TEMPERATURE MAINTENANCE) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Document ID: SOP-MAINT-001) Tj T*
(Document Type: sop) Tj T*
(Revision: Rev 3.2) Tj T*
(Effective Date: 2026-01-15) Tj T*
(Department: Industrial Rotating Equipment Division) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Scope and Equipment Applicability) Tj T*
(This standard operating procedure governs centrifugal pumps, crude transfer pumps,) Tj T*
(and heavy rotating equipment including Pump-01, Pump-02, and Pump-03.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Thermal Operating Limits) Tj T*
(Normal operating temperature for centrifugal pump bearings is 60 to 75 degrees Celsius.) Tj T*
(The continuous operating limit for bearing temperature is 80 degrees Celsius \(80 C\).) Tj T*
(Any observed bearing temperature exceeding 80 degrees Celsius is an abnormal excursion.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Corrective Action Requirements) Tj T*
(If bearing temperature exceeds 80 degrees Celsius:) Tj T*
(  1. Reduce operating load immediately.) Tj T*
(  2. Inspect lubrication condition, oil level, and lubricant viscosity.) Tj T*
(  3. Check bearing condition and alignment for mechanical degradation.) Tj T*
(  4. Escalate for maintenance inspection within 2 hours.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
