BT /F1 11 Tf 50 740 Td 15 TL (STANDARD OPERATING PROCEDURE  PUMP BEARING TEMPERATURE MAINTENANCE) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Document ID: SOP-MAINT-001 \(Page 2\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Critical Escalation and Emergency Thresholds) Tj T*
(If bearing temperature reaches or exceeds 95 degrees Celsius:) Tj T*
(  - Immediate shutdown of the pump unit is mandatory to prevent seizure.) Tj T*
(  - Tag unit as OUT OF SERVICE under Lockout/Tagout protocol.) Tj T*
(  - Drain and replace bearing oil reservoir.) Tj T*
(  - Perform vibration spectral analysis before restart.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Documentation and Quality Records) Tj T*
(All thermal excursions and maintenance actions must be logged in the shift logbook.) Tj T*
(Inspection approval notes must cite SOP-MAINT-001 and record measured deviations.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
